{"slug":"cursed-2000-1yar4p","title":"نفرین شده","titleEn":"The Weber Show","type":"series","year":2000,"rating":6.5,"duration":30,"description":"Cursed, later renamed The Weber Show, is an American sitcom that ran on NBC from 2000–2001. It starred Steven Weber, Amy Pietz, Wendell Pierce, and Chris Elliot.\n\nThe show is notable for having an abrupt title change in the middle of its first season. The initial premise was that its protagonist had been cursed by an ex-girlfriend and thus constantly encountered bad luck. The show failed to find an audience, and so midway through the season the entire \"bad luck\" angle was abruptly dropped. The show was revamped as a more traditional sitcom and renamed The Weber Show. In spite of the change, the show still struggled and was canceled at the end of the season, leaving a cliffhanger unresolved. The show's theme song was written and performed by Liz Phair.","genres":["—"],"poster":"/covers/tt0247134/poster.jpg","backdrop":"/covers/tt0247134/backdrop.jpg","posterUrl":"https://images.metahub.space/poster/small/tt0247134/img","backdropUrl":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt0247134/img","videoUrl":"","trailerUrl":null,"director":"","cast":["Steven Weber","Amy Pietz","Wendell Pierce"],"country":"آمریکا","ageRating":"+13","quality":"1080p","sources":[],"featured":false,"trendingScore":65,"views":64372,"source":"od","addedAt":"2026-09-05T22:02:49.474Z","episodes":[{"season":1,"number":1,"name":"قسمت 1","synopsis":"","duration":30,"videoUrl":"https://dls6.aparatchi-dlcenter.top/DonyayeSerial/series/Cursed/Soft.Sub/S01/720p.Web-DL/Cursed.S01E01.720p.WEB-DL.SoftSub.DonyayeSerial.mkv","sources":[{"q":"720p","v":"زیرنویس چسبیده","url":"https://dls6.aparatchi-dlcenter.top/DonyayeSerial/series/Cursed/Soft.Sub/S01/720p.Web-DL/Cursed.S01E01.720p.WEB-DL.SoftSub.DonyayeSerial.mkv"},{"q":"480p","v":"زیرنویس چسبیده","url":"https://dls6.aparatchi-dlcenter.top/DonyayeSerial/series/Cursed/Soft.Sub/S01/480p.Web-DL/Cursed.S01E01.480